  "scope": [
    "The same retained profile germ gives the exact old-to-new derivative identity on every closed N06 positive gap. Actual retained cells prove that its two scaled endpoints lie inside the same reference annulus.",
    "The genuine N06 product lower is strictly positive in the gap interior; actual adjacent negative model roots provide both zero endpoints. The displayed scaled interval is therefore a unique actual positive component.",
    "The real controlGeometryConditions negative cover and the already proved interior endpoint theorem give the actual negative neighbor at each positive left endpoint. Its same-witness classification leaves a right-tail gap n, a left-tail gap n-1, or one of two fixed exceptional left roots.",
    "The left-endpoint injectivity proves the exceptional components form a finite set and gives one numerical reciprocal-width constant before their indices. No material E0 bound for the finite exceptions is asserted in this source.",
    "All retained P/Gamma/profile/coordinate hypotheses are explicit. No certificate is extracted from arbitrary Through03, and no alternative witness, synthetic partition or supplied target bound is introduced."
  ],
